# Directories under this repo that are NOT this project's own shipped code.
#
# Discovery is a recursive walk for package-lock.json, and a walk cannot tell
# a service you deploy from a fixture committed to exercise the parser. Without
# this file, pointing the console at this repository reports a fleet of fifteen
# services for a project that ships two -- and every downstream number is
# denominated in that count.
#
# Patterns containing a slash are relative to the scan root, so `corpus/` hides
# <root>/corpus and nothing else. Pointing the CLI *at* corpus/ still works:
# the pattern only fires when corpus is a subdirectory of what you asked for.
# Bare names (node_modules, .git) match any component at any depth and are
# always applied, with or without this file.

# Synthetic demo fleet, generated by `blastradius.pkg.cli corpus`.
# Real resolved lockfiles, but for projects nobody deploys.
corpus/

# Fixtures that exist to exercise the lockfile parser and the OSV reader.
tests/fixtures/
